Files under upstream/projects/ are task/evaluation/instruction metadata (normalized newlines and whitespace)
from the publicly published Agent4Sci container images identified in
upstream/images.lock.json. Generated instructions embed the upstream task brief.
Modifications: separate project subtasks into Harbor tasks; pin images/dataset;
build-time train/val staging; separate evaluator/auditor; structured score adapter.

